{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765664,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Uttar \u2013 B-Quiz Arena","festival_id":521442,"organization_id":1076204,"web_url":"nisadya.in","start_date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-19T17:41:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/uttar-b-quiz-arena-national-institute-of-technology-nit-tiruchirappalli-1765664","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>About the Event UTTAR &ndash; B-Quiz:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>UTTAR-B-Quiz Arena<\/strong> is a competitive business quiz designed to test participants across diverse dimensions of the business world, including business and finance, brands, economics, marketing, startups, technology and current affairs. The quiz will challenge knowledge, awareness, analytical ability and presence of mind.<\/li>\n<li>With every stage, the competition gets tougher, and only teams demonstrating consistency, adaptability and quick thinking will reach the final showdown.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to Undergraduate and Postgraduate students.<\/li>\n<li>Students from all academic disciplines are welcome.<\/li>\n<li>Team size: 2&ndash;3 members.<\/li>\n<li>Students of NIT Tiruchirappalli are not eligible to participate.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Stages &amp; Timelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &ndash; The Business Brain | Online Preliminary Round | Mode: Online:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>An online screening round covering a broad spectrum of business, finance, economics, marketing, brands, startups, technology, management, current affairs and business awareness. The top-performing teams will advance to the next stage.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &ndash; The Business War Room | Offline Qualifier Round | Mode: Offline:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The competition moves offline with a challenging mix of business awareness, visual recognition, analytical thinking, connections and application-based challenges. This round tests how well teams think beyond conventional questions and perform under pressure. Approximately 10 teams will advance to the final stage.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 3 &ndash; The Business Championship | Grand Finale | Mode: Offline:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The final battle brings together the top 6 teams. A high-intensity round covering business knowledge, rapid thinking, decision-making, strategy and presence of mind will determine the ultimate champion. <strong>6 Teams. One Final Battle. One Champion.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Broad Areas:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Business &amp; Corporate Affairs.<\/li>\n<li>Finance &amp; Financial Markets.<\/li>\n<li>Economics.<\/li>\n<li>Marketing &amp; Brands.<\/li>\n<li>Startups &amp; Entrepreneurship.<\/li>\n<li>Management &amp; Strategy.<\/li>\n<li>Technology &amp; AI.<\/li>\n<li>Operations &amp; Supply Chain.<\/li>\n<li>Business &amp; Economic Current Affairs.<\/li>\n<li>Business Trivia &amp; General Awareness.<\/li>\n<li>The exact format, structure and nature of questions will be revealed during the respective rounds.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Registration Deadline.<\/li>\n<li>Round 1 &ndash; The Business Brain: Online (Unstop).<\/li>\n<li>Round 2 &ndash; The Business War Room: [Venue], NIT Tiruchirappalli.<\/li>\n<li>Round 3 &ndash; The Business Championship: [Venue], NIT Tiruchirappalli.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":29663114,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-04T17:22:04+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T00:42:06+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id"